WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
Summer Time Blues

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:42.820
If you try as hard as you can, can you still remember what happened that day?

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.990
What happened on that hot summer day…

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:55.160
The weather is nice, and the sky is clear.

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:57.000
It's a good thing we came here, right, nii-san?

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:58.500
Yes.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.250
I guess you're right.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.670
But, why after coming all this way…

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:13.100
do we still have to do all this work?!

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:19.690
Nii-san, let's take a break.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.520
I'll go and bring some refreshments instead.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:24.610
Wait, Kirika.

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.190
I'll go.

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:29.530
Let me take a breather.

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:32.990
Ah, take care, nii-san.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.830
Summer vacation is almost over.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:47.960
Just one more night.

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:51.220
If we start now it won't be too late, Hanazono-san!..

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:54.010
…to make some friendly summer memories…

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.640
Anyway, is Kazune-kun alright?

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:59.770
Don't talk to me right now.

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:02.770
They're here.

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.270
Right next to us.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:10.650
I'll be a goner if I let my guard down.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:18.620
There's a praying mantis on the back of his head.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:32.010
Karin-chan, what's wrong?

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:34.180
I just saw glasses guy!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.220
What? Karasuma?

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.100
Today should only be for first graders.

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:41.810
I'm sure he got in using his student council's privilege.

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:45.360
He followed us all the way here…

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.830
Kazune-kun, are you okay?

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:03.080
You should be more worried about yourself than about me.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.960
If he attacks while I'm in this condition…

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:09.750
What should we do?

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.550
Well…

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.020
Ta-da!

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.230
That's a surprising change from your image.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:31.610
Karin-chan, you're cute.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:34.150
Wai, Hanazono-san!

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:37.620
But you know, you seem to have a lot of costumes like this…

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.700
Yeah. I'm glad that something I brought for tonight's hidden talent show can be of some use.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:46.960
What were you planning on doing at the talent show?

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.460
I also reworked the ring's design.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.880
Since I've done this much, not even Karasuma should recognize you.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:58.140
Ah, by the way, you can still become a goddess with this.

00:04:58.140 --> 00:04:59.260
But don't get it wet.

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:03.810
Um… this really hurts.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:07.440
But, why is the design like this?

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:20.530
The reworking will change back when it gets wet, right?

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.470
G-Glasses guy!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.270
What should I do? What should I do?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:48.310
Please do watch out next time.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.450
I hope I'm not exposed.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.250
That was a wonderful person.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.790
Please do watch out next time.

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:14.380
It's the first time that someone has said something to me, a student council president.

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:21.090
Who are you?

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:28.640
Even though you know that I am the student council president…

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:32.560
I know nothing about you!

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:40.910
How painful.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.070
How agonizing!

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:44.780
What should I do?

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:48.580
A ring?

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.330
Why is there a ring here?

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:54.960
Could this be…

00:06:56.300 --> 00:07:00.380
If you wish to meet me once more, bring that ring to me!

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.800
That must have been her message!

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:07.930
What?

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.100
You forgot your ring?

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:12.270
What should I do?

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.360
Why didn't you go right back?!

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:18.740
- I'm sorry, I didn't notice until I got back here.

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.530
- Ah, microphone test.

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:21.900
Microphone test.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.950
To all first years:

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.370
This voice is…

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:31.040
Glasses guy!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.420
Thank you for gathering here.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:39.380
I will now announce a survival race organized by the Student Council.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:42.840
The rules are simple.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:45.930
The ones who go past all the checkpoints en route,…

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:48.810
and reach the goal the first are the winners.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:52.020
And the wonderful first place prize is…

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:53.810
Student Council President Survival Race

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.610
This naturally designed ring!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.190
That's my-

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.610
The one I made!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.450
That Karasuma…

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.200
He must be planning something.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:09.910
Kazune-kun, what should we do?

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:14.460
But, no matter how many cowardly traps he has set,…

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.290
I'll definitely get the ring back.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:18.540
This has gotten interesting.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:20.300
We're going, Karin.

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:21.840
O-Okay.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:26.890
This is a good idea, if I may say so myself.

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:31.980
If it really is her ring, she should participate in the race!

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.730
And, when she wins…

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:43.900
I'll open up my feelings I have inside my heart for her!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:48.570
Nii-san…

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:55.370
Mission 1: Shout words of love to the student council president from the mountain!

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.630
Words of love to the student council president?

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.710
What do you think that means?

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:03.260
It's probably a joke from the student council president.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:08.050
How naive. This is no joke.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:12.100
Without hiding anything, the reason behind this mission is:

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:16.980
I want that person to shout feelings of love to me!

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:17.850
That's it.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.440
Nii-san…

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:28.450
President Karasuma looks great in his glasses!

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:32.450
Ah, that was no good…

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.200
Let me try!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:35.580
Here I go!

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:38.960
L O V E

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.170
We love president Karasuma!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.130
Why?

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:48.510
Professor Kujyou Love!

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:54.720
I love eating in the mountains!

00:09:58.390 --> 00:09:59.600
Wrong.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.900
What's wrong?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:06.440
Nii-san…

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.990
Kazune-kun, what should we do?

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.660
Listen, don't think of anything.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.080
Empty your head.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:18.370
Empty my head?

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:27.260
Karasuma!!!

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:31.800
The truth is I've always…

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:32.850
Lo…

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:34.220
Lo…

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:37.850
Squats.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:39.440
Lo…

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:42.690
Scuba diving.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:44.150
Lo…

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.860
Sky diving!

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:49.650
Lo…

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:57.250
Hang on, Kazune-kun!

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.000
Kazune-chan!

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.670
Kazune-kun!

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:04.750
Why?

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:09.170
All I had to do was shout it out.

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:11.930
Your body must be rejecting it.

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:17.850
I see. This must be part of Karasuma's plan.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:20.350
I'm sorry…

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:24.230
that I can't help at a time like this.

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:27.530
Kazune-kun…

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:35.830
Student council president, you…

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:38.790
Freshwater eel!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.620
Freshwater eel!

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.040
Freshwater eel!

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:49.460
Freshwater eel!

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:03.100
I'm… I'm…

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:08.860
I'm a freshwater eel.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:11.570
Nii-san…

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.870
I cannot say a bad thing about this wonderful sound.

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:19.370
Ah, how pleasant.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:23.870
This is the first time in ages that I've seen him smile like this.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:30.380
Wow, Karin-chan passed the test.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:33.630
That can't be!

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:37.640
You're amazing, Karin-chan!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:43.390
It seems he still hasn't recognized who you really are.

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:45.520
Go, Karin.

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.020
I'll follow you soon.

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.530
Okay, I got it!

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:52.720
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.260
I am God!

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.220
You moron.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.220
It's a croquette!

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.410
Well, let's see…

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:09.920
Mission 2: Make some home cooking filled with love for the student council president!

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.380
Home cooking?

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:21.010
What on earth is that hungry glasses guy thinking?

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:30.230
The reason for this second check point is:

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:36.400
My darling, I want to eat your home cooked meal!

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.160
That's it.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.950
Seems like you're enjoying yourself, nii-san.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:48.750
We may have just used our student council privilege to get here, but I'm glad we came to this school in the forest.

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:58.680
Anyway, I just have to give it my all!

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.390
There we go!

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:02.260
Here we go!

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.310
No!!!

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:35.130
What is this?

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:41.930
It says "Eel Saute".

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.510
Eh, eel?

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:51.520
I see… eel saute, right?

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:56.690
It doesn't look remotely like eel.

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:24.970
God Thunder!

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:28.680
God Thunder!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:31.980
God Thunder!

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:42.240
Nii-san.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.450
Nii-san!

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.780
Hang on, nii-san!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.790
For a second, my life flashed before me…

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:57.800
No, just the fights flashed by like a revolving lantern.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:01.420
Are you okay, nii-san?

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:05.470
This is her home cooking…

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.560
It has such an impact!

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:13.980
This impact.

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:15.980
This destructive energy.

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:20.280
This is without a doubt, my love!

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:23.610
Alright!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:26.870
You did it, Karin-chan!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:33.580
Huh? Kazune-chan isn't here…

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:38.500
Is this the last one?

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:44.720
Last mission: Wear the designated clothes, and jump over the valley using a rope!

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.800
The designated clothes…

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:55.520
My panties will be perfectly visible if I wear this!

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:56.690
Who's hobby is this?!

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:58.900
It' my hobby, of course!

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:02.280
For just a moment you will be perfectly coordinated with me, and then your body will move forward…

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:07.450
You will jump over the valley with the rope and into my heart!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:11.450
Yes, a perfect situation, if I say so myself.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:15.790
This is so embarrassing!

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:16.710
Karin.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:20.420
What's the problem?

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.210
Eh! Kazune-kun!

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.720
What's with that outfit?

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:28.930
I disguised myself so that Karasuma won't find me.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.310
You really do have a lot of costumes.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:35.180
I brought it thinking I could use it during the hidden talent contest, I'm glad that it's of use.

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:39.520
What was he intending to do?..

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:40.690
This is bad!

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:43.530
Nii-san, what's wrong?

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:48.660
She's being attacked by a bear!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:52.410
I'm sorry that I'm making you wear that outfit.

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:55.790
It's to get back the ring from him…

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:03.000
Hang on tight!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:03.710
Yes!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:12.470
Karin!

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:20.810
Dammit!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.750
Kazune-kun?

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:57.100
Kazune-kun, you protected me while we were falling down.

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:00.350
No I didn't, I'm just not good at falling.

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.070
I'm sorry.

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:09.280
You're cold because I made you wear that outfit, right?

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:11.160
Karin.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:13.830
It's okay.

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:17.790
This outfit it pretty warm.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.170
It really is.

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.890
I finally found you!

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.140
My beloved one!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:42.940
For a bear to touch my beloved…

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:45.150
Begone!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:51.530
Come, it's save now.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.660
Please take…

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:57.740
your ring and my heart filled with feelings of love for you!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:00.370
What are you thinking?!

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:12.880
How wonderful, her punch really hits the spot.

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:46.290
Kazune-chan, you should be sleeping.

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.630
She's right, you haven't slept at all.

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:51.760
I'm fine now.

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.690
- We're lucky! 
- Even at this hour!

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:09.940
To be able... to see Kujyou-kun.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:13.440
I'm glad we got the ring back safe and sound.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:18.120
If you hadn't forgotten your ring in the first place, all of this-

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.990
Kazune-chan.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:23.960
It's okay now.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:28.000
I'm sorry. It was my fault.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:29.960
It's fine.

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:32.420
Are you feeling okay?

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.430
Yeah. Much better.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:39.640
All because that bear costume was warm.

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:00.990
If I concentrate as hard as I can… and close my eyes, your wonderful smile still comes to mind.

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:05.330
If I concentrate as hard as I can… and close my eyes, your wonderful smile still comes to mind.

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:15.550
It's been a while since I've seen him smile so gently.

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:19.050
I believe.

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:24.680
I believe that I will one day meet you again.

00:22:25.930 --> 00:22:28.310
Someday, I'm sure of it.

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:33.440
Are you an idiot?

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.670
The Present is a Mysterious Ring

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:07.590
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:10.410
The present is a mysterious ring!

00:24:10.410 --> 00:24:13.710
Kirika-senpai is going to give me a ring as a present!

00:24:13.710 --> 00:24:15.170
I'm so happy!

00:24:15.500 --> 00:24:19.010
But, is it just me, or is this ring kind of suspicious?..
